<title>UK: Cie Bancaire sets 200 mln stg seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire sets 200 mln stg seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIE BANCIARE</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    04.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    04.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.895    FULL FEES   22.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENG	 MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC   15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	CIE BANCIARE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
